insert into recipe_memories (id, recipe_title, recipe_details, memory_story, author_name, photo_url) values
('b1b2c3d4-0001-4001-8001-000000000001','Nana''s Sunday Tomato Sauce','Ingredients: San Marzano tomatoes, garlic, basil, olive oil, salt. Method: Gently fry garlic in olive oil, add hand-crushed tomatoes, then simmer for 45 minutes. Finish with basil.','Every Sunday morning, Nana started this sauce before anyone else woke up. She said good sauce needed time and patience, just like a family. I learned it by standing beside her at the stove.','Maria Conti','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555949258-eb67b1ef0ceb?w=900'),
('b1b2c3d4-0002-4002-8002-000000000002','Dad''s Buttermilk Pancakes','Ingredients: flour, baking powder, sugar, buttermilk, eggs and butter. Method: Mix wet and dry ingredients separately, fold gently, and cook on a buttered griddle.','Saturday was Pancake Day in our house. Dad announced it like a holiday and made every stack six pancakes high. Making them still makes the kitchen feel full.','James Kowalski','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528207776546-365bb710ee93?w=900'),
('b1b2c3d4-0003-4003-8003-000000000003','Grandma Chen''s Dumplings','Ingredients: ground pork, napa cabbage, ginger, spring onion, soy sauce, sesame oil and wrappers. Method: Mix filling, pleat wrappers, then boil until floating.','Every Lunar New Year we folded dumplings around Grandma''s table. She quietly repaired our uneven pleats and told us every dumpling brought a little luck.','Lily Chen','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563245372-f21724e3856d?w=900'),
('b1b2c3d4-0004-4004-8004-000000000004','Aunt Rosa''s Tres Leches Cake','Ingredients: sponge cake, condensed milk, evaporated milk, cream and cinnamon. Method: Bake the sponge, poke it warm, soak overnight, then cover with cream.','Aunt Rosa brought this cake to every birthday and graduation. At eighty, she finally shared the recipe on handwritten index cards for all her nieces.','Sofia Mendoza','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464305795204-6f5bbfc7fb81?w=900'),
('b1b2c3d4-0005-4005-8005-000000000005','Mum''s Lentil Soup','Ingredients: red lentils, onion, carrots, garlic, tomatoes, cumin, turmeric and stock. Method: Soften vegetables, add spices and lentils, simmer, then blend halfway.','This soup appeared whenever anyone was sad, sick, heartbroken, or cold. Mum never made a speech; she just placed a warm bowl in front of you.','Amara Osei','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547592166-23ac45744acd?w=900')
